    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "anchor": "기본-수치-p2",
      "text": {
        "en": "Occupied ground passed through `dispute → occupation → stabilization → integration`. Integration required `A>=65`, `L>=55`, `R>=60`, `K>=0.5`, and `S<=0.25` to hold for 3 consecutive days.",
        "ko": "점령지는 `분쟁 → 점령 → 안정화 → 통합` 순서로 전이한다. `A>=65`, `L>=55`, `R>=60`, `K>=0.5`, `S<=0.25`를 3일 연속 만족하면 통합된다."
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "code",
      "anchor": "기본-수치-code3",
      "language": "mermaid",
      "text": {
        "en": "stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --> Disputed\n  Disputed --> Occupied: outcome of battle or negotiation\n  Occupied --> Stabilized: A>=50, L>=35\n  Stabilized --> Integrated: integration conditions held 3 days\n  Integrated --> Stabilized: shortage · isolation · overreach\n  Stabilized --> Occupied: collapse of authority\n  Occupied --> Disputed: loss of defense or rule",
        "ko": "stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --> 분쟁\n  분쟁 --> 점령: 전투·협상 결과\n  점령 --> 안정화: A>=50, L>=35\n  안정화 --> 통합: 3일간 통합 조건 충족\n  통합 --> 안정화: 부족·고립·과확장\n  안정화 --> 점령: 권위 붕괴\n  점령 --> 분쟁: 수비·통치 상실"
      }
